<view class="page page-safe login-page">
  <view class="brand-mark">装</view>
  <view class="brand-line">RENOVATION LEDGER</view>
  <view class="title login-title">装修记</view>
  <view class="muted login-sub">一笔一笔，记到入住。预算、进度、问题、合同，全流程留在自己手里。</view>

  <view class="login-card">
    <view class="login-row">
      <view class="icon-square">01</view>
      <view class="flex1">
        <view class="title-sm">记账与预算</view>
        <view class="tiny">分类支出、合同待付、可用余额</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="login-row">
      <view class="icon-square">02</view>
      <view class="flex1">
        <view class="title-sm">进度与现场</view>
        <view class="tiny">节点、照片、问题闭环</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="login-row">
      <view class="icon-square">03</view>
      <view class="flex1">
        <view class="title-sm">合同与统计</view>
        <view class="tiny">付款计划、费用构成、导出</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn btn-block login-btn" bindtap="wechatLogin" loading="{{loading}}">微信一键登录</button>
  <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block login-btn" bindtap="demoLogin" loading="{{loading}}">服务端开发演示账号</button>
  <view class="muted login-note">登录只把 code 发到服务端换取会话；账本、合同、进度全部写入服务端数据库，本地不再保存真实账本。小程序包内不存放 AppSecret、数据库账号或管理员密钥。</view>
</view>
